            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.46.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 46.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.26.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 26.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " The sons of Perez: Hezron and Hamul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.7.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Josh 7.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.4.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kings 4.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " The sons of Zerah: Zimri, Ethan, Heman, Calcol, and Dara, five in all. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Carmi: Achar, the troubler of Israel, who transgressed in the matter of the devoted thing; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Ethan's son was Azariah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Hezron, that were born to him: Jerahmeel, Ram, and Chelubai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ram was the father of Amminadab, and Amminadab was the father of Nahshon, prince of the sons of Judah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahshon was the father of Salma, Salma of Boaz, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boaz of Obed, Obed of Jesse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesse was the father of Eliab his first-born, Abinadab the second, Shime-a the third, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nethanel the fourth, Raddai the fifth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ozem the sixth, David the seventh; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and their sisters were Zeruiah and Abigail. The sons of Zeruiah: Abishai, Joab, and Asahel, three. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abigail bore Amasa, and the father of Amasa was Jether the Ishmaelite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Caleb the son of Hezron had children by his wife Azubah, and by Jerioth; and these were her sons: Jesher, Shobab, and Ardon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Azubah died, Caleb married Ephrath, who bore him Hur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hur was the father of Uri, and Uri was the father of Bezalel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afterward Hezron went in to the daughter of Machir the father of Gilead, whom he married when he was sixty years old; and she bore him Segub; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Segub was the father of Jair, who had twenty-three cities in the land of Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Geshur and Aram took from them Havvoth-jair, Kenath and its villages, sixty towns. All these were descendants of Machir, the father of Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After the death of Hezron, Caleb went in to Ephrathah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Vg: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "in Caleb Ephrathah",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the wife of Hezron his father, and she bore him Ashhur, the father of Tekoa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Jerahmeel, the first-born of Hezron: Ram, his first-born, Bunah, Oren, Ozem, and Ahijah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jerahmeel also had another wife, whose name was Atarah; she was the mother of Onam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Ram, the first-born of Jerahmeel: Maaz, Jamin, and Eker. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Onam: Shammai and Jada. The sons of Shammai: Nadab and Abishur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The name of Abishur's wife was Abihail, and she bore him Ahban and Molid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Nadab: Seled and Appa-im; and Seled died childless. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Appa-im: Ishi. The sons of Ishi: Sheshan. The sons of Sheshan: Ahlai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Jada, Shammai's brother: Jether and Jonathan; and Jether died childless. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Jonathan: Peleth and Zaza. These were the descendants of Jerahmeel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now Sheshan had no sons, only daughters; but Sheshan had an Egyptian slave, whose name was Jarha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Sheshan gave his daughter in marriage to Jarha his slave; and she bore him Attai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Attai was the father of Nathan and Nathan of Zabad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zabad was the father of Ephlal, and Ephlal of Obed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obed was the father of Jehu, and Jehu of Azariah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azariah was the father of Helez, and Helez of Ele-asah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ele-asah was the father of Sismai, and Sismai of Shallum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shallum was the father of Jekamiah, and Jekamiah of Elishama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Caleb the brother of Jerahmeel: Mareshah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.42",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mesha",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " his first-born, who was the father of Ziph. The sons of Mareshah: Hebron.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.42",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the father of Hebron",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Hebron: Korah, Tappuah, Rekem, and Shema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shema was the father of Raham, the father of Jorke-am; and Rekem was the father of Shammai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The son of Shammai: Maon; and Maon was the father of Beth-zur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ephah also, Caleb's concubine, bore Haran, Moza, and Gazez; and Haran was the father of Gazez. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Jahdai: Regem, Jotham, Geshan, Pelet, Ephah, and Shaaph. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maacah, Caleb's concubine, bore Sheber and Tirhanah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She also bore Shaaph the father of Madmannah, Sheva the father of Machbenah and the father of Gibe-a; and the daughter of Caleb was Achsah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These were the descendants of Caleb.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.50",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Vg: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "son",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of Hur the first-born of Ephrathah: Shobal the father of Kiriath-jearim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salma, the father of Bethlehem, and Hareph the father of Beth-gader. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shobal the father of Kiriath-jearim had other sons: Haroeh, half of the Menuhoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the families of Kiriath-jearim: the Ithrites, the Puthites, the Shumathites, and the Mishraites; from these came the Zorathites and the Eshtaolites. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Salma: Bethlehem, the Netophathites, Atroth-beth-joab, and half of the Manahathites, the Zorites. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The families also of the scribes that dwelt at Jabez: the Tirathites, the Shime-athites, and the Sucathites. These are the Kenites who came from Hammath, the father of the house of Rechab.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.55"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
